{"id": "u21", "config": "router", "tenant": "bfsi", "channel": "text", "lang": "en", "difficulty": "hard", "hardest": false, "category": "reasoning", "mode": "real", "rule_id": "R3-hard-en", "reason": "hard cue ['interest'] in English: frontier model", "detected_lang": "en", "pii_masked": 0, "router_overhead_ms": 0.392, "router_tokens": 0, "human_review": null, "holding_phrase": false, "model": "glm-5.3", "effort": "default", "in_tokens": 59, "out_tokens": 634, "cost_inr": 0.254694, "latency_ms": 3626.0, "attempts": [{"model": "glm-5.3", "effort": "default", "status": "ok", "in_tokens": 59, "out_tokens": 634, "reasoning_tokens": 354, "cost_inr": 0.254694, "latency_s": 3.626}], "reasoning_tokens": 354, "answer": "# Comparing the Two Options\n\n**Option A: 7% Simple Interest**\n\n$$SI = \\frac{P \\times r \\times t}{100} = \\frac{100000 \\times 7 \\times 2}{100} = \\text{Rs } 14{,}000$$\n\n**Option B: 6.8% Compounded Yearly**\n\n$$A = 100000 \\times (1.068)^2 = 100000 \\times 1.140624 = \\text{Rs } 1{,}14{,}062.40$$\n\n$$CI = 1{,}14{,}062.40 - 1{,}00{,}000 = \\text{Rs } 14{,}062.40$$\n\n**Comparison**\n\n| | Interest |\n|---|---|\n| Option A (Simple) | Rs 14,000 |\n| Option B (Compound) | Rs 14,062.40 |\n\n**Conclusion:** Even though Option B has a lower rate, compounding wins over 2 years.\n\n$$\\text{Difference} = 14{,}062.40 - 14{,}000 = \\text{Rs } 62.40$$\n\n**Option B gives more interest by approximately Rs 62.**", "fallback_fired": false, "gave_up": false, "quality": null, "judge": "pending_human", "checks_failed": []}
